          · simp only [VExpr.forallN, VExpr.forallE.injEq, true_and]
            exact targetEq
          · intro binder member
            simp only [List.mem_cons] at member
            rcases member with rfl | member
            · exact targetDomainFree
            · exact bindersFree binder member
          · simpa only [
              AddInductive.ConstructorBlockRecursiveViewTrace.targetIdx,
